      MaterialExpressionEditorY=1450
      MaterialExpressionGuid=A458B866488E868724B553935C88DDD1
      Material="/Script/Engine.Material'FM_World_SubUV_color_A'"
      Desc="Source-driven reconstruction adapter, not original shader wiring. Root Actual15 confirms source slot5/World03 triangle producer; exact original clamp math is stripped. Keep existing eight scalar inputs and density formula, emission path, particle colors/curves/DP/timings/sizes/PS/material modes/static switch. Add one scalar default0 returning prior density for every other child. Child03 alone uses source RequiredModule_7.CutoutTexture FT_Sphere_CutOutTex as Tex_Opa and source AlphaThreshold0.5 as new scalar override. Additional existing sampler RGB input computes arithmetic mean, matching OSM_ColorBrightness channel selection; float shader mean versus engine integer CPU mean is explicitly different precision. Opacity becomes bounded existing density times saturate((meanRGB-threshold)/(1-threshold)); at threshold it is0 and at brightness1 it is1. Source threshold and texture are direct metadata; normalization and opt-in topology are calculated/reconstructed, not original. No arbitrary0.1 edge width. Source/source-required/native-required agree, but native live DDC BoundingGeometry remains unobserved. Source numeric values, children other than03 and original static overrides remain intact. Fresh full and isolated actual RHI quality/Root acceptance required; original parity not claimed."
   End Object
